  "data": {
    "name": "references/types.md",
    "version": "0.1.1",
    "content": "# Core types\n\nGenerated from the embedded pack `TypeDef` and `FieldDef` values. Do not edit this file by hand. Run `cargo run -p mnemic-core --bin mnemic-contract`.\n\n`folder` in TOML is `folders` here. A string becomes one entry. A list stays a list. `type` in TOML is `kind`: `string`, `strings`, or `date`. `target` is set when the field points at another type.\n\nA file `<vault>/types/<type>.toml` replaces that type declaration whole. `<vault>/types/<type>.md` replaces that type's body template. The same file stem wins over the built-in type.\n\n## decision\n\n- folders: `decisions`\n- timeline: yes\n- states: `proposed`, `accepted`, `superseded`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n  - `date` date optional\n\n## idea\n\n- folders: `ideas`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `open`, `parked`, `adopted`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n\n## journal\n\n- folders: `journal`\n- timeline: yes\n- states: `open`, `closed`\n- fields:\n  - `date` date required\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n\n## note\n\n- folders: `inbox`, `notes`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `open`, `filed`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n\n## org\n\n- folders: `orgs`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `active`, `dissolved`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n  - `url` string optional\n\n## person\n\n- folders: `people`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `current`, `former`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n  - `email` string optional\n  - `phone` string optional\n  - `org` string optional, target `org`\n\n## place\n\n- folders: `places`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `current`, `former`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n  - `address` string optional\n\n## project\n\n- folders: `projects`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `active`, `paused`, `done`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n  - `goal` string optional\n\n## source\n\n- folders: `sources`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `unread`, `read`, `archived`\n- fields:\n  - `path` string optional\n  - `url` string optional\n  - `sha256` string optional\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n\n## topic\n\n- folders: `topics`\n- timeline: no\n- states: `active`, `archived`\n- fields:\n  - `aliases` strings optional\n\n"
  },
  "error": null
}
